                          </p>
                          {crmCustomerData?.province && crmCustomerData?.province !== crmCustomerData?.cityRegion && (
                            <p className={`text-xs ${
                              isPrimaryAddressDisabled ? 'text-gray-500' : 'text-green-600'
                            }`}>
                              🏛️ {t.province}: {crmCustomerData.province}
